## Changelog Menu
dl_vw:changelog_title=§lVanilla Waypoints Changelog
dl_vw:changelog_1.9.8=§l§6\nVersion 1.9.8:\n§r§9[#]§7 Bug Fixes.\n\n
dl_vw:changelog_1.9.7=§l§6\nVersion 1.9.7:\n§r§6[!]§r Support for Minecraft 26.40 and higher.\n§r§9[#]§7 Bug Fixes.\n\n
dl_vw:changelog_1.9.6=§l§e\nVersion 1.9.6:\n§r§9[#]§r A visual bug with the available waypoints counter in "list" organization mode was fixed and improved that counter in this mode.\n§r§6[!]§7 You can now set a minimum of 0 waypoints in the Nether and the End (this is in response to many requests from those who do not want waypoints in these dimensions on their servers).\n\n
dl_vw:changelog_1.9.5=§l§e\nVersion 1.9.5:\n§r§6[!]§r Support for Minecraft 26.33 and higher.\n§r§a[+]§7 Added "Organization Style" option to the Global Settings.\n§r§a[+]§r Added "Enable Inactive Threshold" option to the Global Settings.\n§r§a[^]§7 Increased max public waypoints per player from 10 to 50.\n§r§a[^]§7 Increased maximum waypoints per dimension from 50 to 80.\n§r§a[^]§7 Increased maximum teleport cooldown time from 30 seconds to 120 seconds.\n§r§9[#]§r Simplify toggle labels, "ON" and "OFF" in the labels have been removed.\n§r§9[#]§7 Revamped and improved menu interface.\n§r§9[#]§7 Merge "Cancel Smoke Particles" toggle into "Show Particles" toggle.\n§r§9[#]§7 The welcome message has been fixed; it no longer appears every time the world starts.\n§r§9[#]§7 Other minor internal changes, fixes and improvements.\n\n
dl_vw:changelog_1.9.4=§l§e\nVersion 1.9.4:\n§r§6[!]§r Support for Minecraft 26.32 and higher.\n§r§a[+]§7 Added a countdown teleport sound effect.\n§r§a[+]§r Added cancellation particles.\n§r§a[+]§r Added an arriving teleport sound and camera effect.\n\n
dl_vw:changelog_1.9.3=§l§e\nVersion 1.9.3:\n§r§b[*]§r The operator system has been completely rewritten! Now the operator is taken directly from the world/server/realm, no tags, no errors. This will fix many of the problems with the previous system. Furthermore, over 250 lines of code have been removed, making the add-on much smaller!\n\n
dl_vw:changelog_1.9.2=§l§e\nVersion 1.9.2:\n§r§6[!]§r Support for Minecraft Bedrock 26.23 and higher.\n\n
dl_vw:changelog_1.9.1=§l§e\nVersion 1.9.1:\n§r§6[!]§r Support for Minecraft Bedrock 26.20 and higher.\n\n
dl_vw:changelog_1.9.0=§l§e\nVersion 1.9.0:\n§r§a[+]§r Added Death Waypoints. \n§r§a[+]§7 Added Interdimensional Teleport Support. \n§r§a[+]§r Added Inactive Threshold (This function is for OPs; when a public waypoint is inactive during the configured days, OPs will have the option to delete them by interacting with them... The button will be displayed with red text). \n§r§a[+]§7 Added Death Waypoint button expiry slider.\n§r§9[*]§r Minor internal changes.\n\n
